        "name": "Hallowed Mist",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Gwen summons mist that protects her from enemies outside of it. She can only be targeted by enemies who enter the mist.",
        "bodyHtml": "Gwen summons the Hallowed Mist, making her Untargetable to all enemies (except towers) outside the zone for 4 seconds or until she leaves it. While in the Mist, Gwen gains (22/24/26/28/30 + (7% Ability Power)) <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">Armor</span> and <span>Magic Resist</span>.<br /><br />Gwen can <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> this Ability once to call the Mist to her. This will automatically <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> the first time Gwen attempts to leave the zone.",
