        "bodyHtml": "Gwen dashes and empowers her Attacks for 4 seconds.<br /><br />Empowered Attacks gain <span>30/42.5/55/67.5/80% Attack Speed</span>, <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(15 + (20% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> <span>On-Hit</span>, 75 range, and the first one to hit an enemy refunds 25/35/45/55/65% of this Ability's Cooldown.",
