      "R": {
        "slot": "R",
        "id": "GwenR",
        "name": "Needlework",
        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "Gwen hurls a needle that slows enemies hit, deals magic damage, and applies A Thousand Cuts to champions hit. <br><br>This ability can be cast up to two more times, with each cast throwing additional needles and dealing more damage. ",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">First Cast:</span> Hurl a needle that deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(30/50/70 + (10% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> by 40/50/60% for 1.5 seconds, and applies <span>A Thousand Cuts</span> to all enemies hit. Gwen can <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> this ability up to 2 additional times within 6 seconds (1s cooldown between casts).<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Second Cast:</span> Fire three needles to deal <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(90/150/210 + (30% Ability Power)) magic damage</span><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Third Cast:</span> Fire five needles to deal <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(150/250/350 + (50% Ability Power)) magic damage</span><br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Subsequent needle hits on the same unit <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slow</span> by 15/20/25% instead.<br />Max damage: (270/450/630 + (90% Ability Power)), plus (9% + (0.054% Ability Power)) max health damage from <span>A Thousand Cuts</span>.</span>",
